[
{
  type: install
  message: <<EOM
uBridge needs elevated privileges to open TAP devices and raw sockets.  It
is installed setuid root (mode 4755), the same model used by ping(8), so
the GNS3 server can run as an unprivileged user.

To narrow the exposure, restrict execution to a dedicated group (for
example, the gns3 user created by net/gns3-server):

  # chgrp gns3 %%PREFIX%%/bin/ubridge
  # chmod 4750 %%PREFIX%%/bin/ubridge

The GNS3 server finds the binary automatically.  To point it elsewhere, set
ubridge_path in gns3_server.conf.
EOM
}
]
